```json
{
  "method": "GET",
  "url": "https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/objects/example.org/relationships/subdomains",
  "query_params": {
    "key": "my_api",
    "limit": 10,
    "continuation_cursor": "abc",
    "attributes": ["id", "context_attributes"]
  }
}
```

This JSON represents the request you would send to the VirusTotal API to retrieve up to 10 subdomain relationships for `example.org`, starting at the cursor `"abc"`, and requesting only the `id` and `context_attributes` fields for each related object.
